# Formspree endpoint for the booking form, targeted at juanauto78769@gmail.com.
# The live ID (mzebwqjy) is already hardcoded as the default in
# components/BookingForm.tsx, so .env.local is only needed if you want to
# point at a *different* Formspree form (e.g. a separate one for local
# testing so test submissions don't land in the real inbox).
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=mzebwqjy
